    "text": "Consider the complex ions, trans- <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>en</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>*</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cis</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>en</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>.</mo></math> The correct statement&nbsp;regarding them is :",
