    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/48530474-be5e-4e18-bfe2-786c16c7b6c3-image.png\" style=\"width: 214px; height: 227px;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Have Plane of symmetry so will be optically inactive.</p><p>Trans-[Co(en) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"\"><mmultiscripts><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>2</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0f9b0a61-3097-4f17-99a2-d9052caffa5a-image.png\" style=\"width: 405px; height: 214px;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>cis-[Co(en) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"\"><mmultiscripts><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>2</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> is optically active without plane of symmetry.</p>",
